1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,819
Everybody asks who made the pelau.

2
00:00:02,819 --> 00:00:06,081
Your black cake is gone before the speeches start.

3
00:00:06,081 --> 00:00:09,475
But right now people only find you through a cousin,

4
00:00:09,475 --> 00:00:11,693
a church group or a WhatsApp chat.

5
00:00:12,593 --> 00:00:16,465
Sweet Hand is a new site where people in Toronto and the

6
00:00:16,465 --> 00:00:18,954
GTA find Caribbean caterers by dish,

7
00:00:18,954 --> 00:00:20,474
by island and by area.

8
00:00:20,474 --> 00:00:24,000
Jamaican, Trini, Guyanese, Bajan, Haitian and more,

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,176
each one by name.

10
00:00:25,176 --> 00:00:28,632
It opens on Thursday the twenty-sixth of November,

11
00:00:28,632 --> 00:00:30,983
right before the Christmas orders.

12
00:00:31,883 --> 00:00:34,064
You get your own page: your photos,

13
00:00:34,064 --> 00:00:37,865
your menu with dietary tags, the areas you serve and the size

14
00:00:37,865 --> 00:00:39,174
of event you take on.

15
00:00:39,174 --> 00:00:43,723
People send you an enquiry, and you agree the details with them directly.

16
00:00:44,173 --> 00:00:45,257
It's free to list.

17
00:00:45,257 --> 00:00:47,849
You set the menu, the batches and the days.

18
00:00:47,849 --> 00:00:49,898
And your home address never shows,

19
00:00:49,898 --> 00:00:51,405
only the areas you serve.

20
00:00:52,305 --> 00:00:56,141
The first 100 caterers who register get a free photoshoot:

21
00:00:56,141 --> 00:00:58,721
10 of their dishes, shot in our studio.

22
00:00:58,721 --> 00:01:02,822
In return we ask for a complete profile and a launch-day post.

23
00:01:03,722 --> 00:01:06,688
We're also exploring a few ideas for later,

24
00:01:06,688 --> 00:01:09,448
like delivery through a courier partner,

25
00:01:09,448 --> 00:01:12,414
and awards such as GTA's Best Jerk Chicken.

26
00:01:12,414 --> 00:01:14,346
They're ideas, not promises.

27
00:01:15,246 --> 00:01:18,146
Go to sweethand.ca and press Join as a caterer.

28
00:01:18,146 --> 00:01:20,677
Add your business name and your own name,

29
00:01:20,677 --> 00:01:23,824
and you're on your way; it takes about two minutes.

30
00:01:23,824 --> 00:01:25,984
Then follow Sweet Hand on Facebook,

31
00:01:25,984 --> 00:01:29,625
so you hear about the launch and the photoshoot days first.

32
00:01:30,075 --> 00:01:32,187
Sweet Hand. Your sweet hand, found.
